From: OpenWrt desktop integration <noreply@openwrt.org>
Subject: Keep format checks enabled for xsum with hardened toolchains

OpenWrt enables -Werror=format-security. Disabling -Wformat on this single
source makes GCC reject the option combination before compiling the file.
Keep the format checks instead of weakening security diagnostics globally.

--- a/js/src/xsum/moz.build
+++ b/js/src/xsum/moz.build
@@ -21,1 +21,1 @@
-SOURCES['xsum.cpp'].flags += ['-Wno-implicit-fallthrough', '-Wno-format', '-Wno-unused-value']
+SOURCES['xsum.cpp'].flags += ['-Wno-implicit-fallthrough', '-Wno-unused-value']
